    englishExplanation: "Ānandagiri’s verbatim sub-commentary (Ṭīkā) elucidating Śaṅkara’s Bhāṣya on Āgama Kārikā 20 (The Identity of Taijasa with 'U': Superiority and Intermediacy).",
